{"data": [{"author_id": "11348282", "created_at": "2026-11-09T16:45:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119833829389041896"], "id": "2119833829389041896", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 176, "impression_count": 1053299, "like_count": 2684, "quote_count": 26, "reply_count": 99, "retweet_count": 385}, "text": "The weekend ends. The mission keeps going.\n\nThis is what American ambition looks like. 🇺🇸🚀 https://t.co/C5d5Z0imPm", "url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2119833829389041896"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-09T16:40:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119832618313121799"], "id": "2119832618313121799", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 3201, "like_count": 42, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119828294090760686", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "human tastes.... aren't fake.... https://t.co/6YjA3NGpKk", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2119832618313121799"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-09T16:33:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119830793279197612"], "id": "2119830793279197612", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 497, "impression_count": 44152, "like_count": 1229, "quote_count": 13, "reply_count": 16, "retweet_count": 118}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119803446412878094", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The single longest Roman inscription EVER discovered is a 2000+ word INCREDIBLE wifeguy inscription honoring his (objectively incredible) wife. It includes detailed descriptions of her being revenged on her parent's killers and getting into street brawls.\nhttps://t.co/VuN43SK3Rd https://t.co/0NWPRIv2ED", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2119830793279197612"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-09T16:29:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119829855227285731"], "id": "2119829855227285731", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2837, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119798307509944500", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I wrote about this on my Substack last month-- I refer to it as Foomsday, the day population was supposed to go foom. https://t.co/jJm6myoRUx", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2119829855227285731"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-09T16:29:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119829659109953756"], "id": "2119829659109953756", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 2969, "like_count": 99, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 8}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119607889103142974", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "i actually agree that infidelity was not the worst thing jensen huang did\n\nshilling for the ccp's policies and trying to extort the republic into changing foreign policy to fit his company's, and the ccp's, bottom line was, in fact, the worst thing jensen huang did https://t.co/JFxbYdvhvq", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2119829659109953756"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-09T15:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119807227473326349"], "id": "2119807227473326349", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 4207, "like_count": 53, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119779258188828973", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "there are a lot more asians in the world than white people\n\nasian preferences are a closer proxy for \"human-normal preferences\" than white preferences https://t.co/wWOOnaR1uh", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2119807227473326349"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-09T14:57:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119806617327919537"], "id": "2119806617327919537", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 7410, "like_count": 143, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 6}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119800183055921510", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Actually this is the true American spirit. You should simply live life on the assumption that God has mandated you for great things, and then go do things. https://t.co/mQkZZpOFE6", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2119806617327919537"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-09T14:20:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119797154218738172"], "id": "2119797154218738172", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 3066, "like_count": 24, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119560847252992108", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This checks out https://t.co/r9dHqrbc8w", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2119797154218738172"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-09T13:45:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119788394918404459"], "id": "2119788394918404459", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1780, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119740253481152667", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "ON THE OTHER HAND\n\nperhaps the greatest wifeguy energy in the history exists in the form of the Laudatio Turiae \n\nsocieties contain varieties! https://t.co/1L77YFOZ6y", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2119788394918404459"}, {"author_id": "21436960", "created_at": "2026-11-09T09:58:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119731262248132963"], "id": "2119731262248132963", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 18096, "like_count": 266, "quote_count": 12, "reply_count": 34, "retweet_count": 52}, "text": "Three years of the Zero Debris Charter!\n\nMore than 250 signatories from 36 countries are now working towards a zero debris future by 2030, with confidence growing that the technical targets can be achieved, and new members joining last week in Brasília. \n\nRead more: https://t.co/F20mdNG57P", "url": "https://x.com/esa/status/2119731262248132963"}, {"author_id": "610659001", "created_at": "2026-11-09T08:42:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119712175782510862"], "id": "2119712175782510862", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 221, "impression_count": 94294, "like_count": 1232, "quote_count": 34, "reply_count": 58, "retweet_count": 246}, "text": "China reduced extreme poverty fast. \nBut Indonesia has not been far behind. https://t.co/jrdXaIfoJA", "url": "https://x.com/MaxCRoser/status/2119712175782510862"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-09T01:26:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119602532452319483"], "id": "2119602532452319483", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 42, "impression_count": 22301, "like_count": 558, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 44, "retweet_count": 37}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119576824636211406", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I actually can’t understand how any red-blooded American can fail to admire Sikhism and Sikh culture.\n\nLoving around Sikhs in Montréal convinced me that I would be very happy to have lots of Sikh neighbors anywhere. https://t.co/zDTy7oQg08", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2119602532452319483"}, {"author_id": "19355829", "created_at": "2026-11-08T22:26:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119557303963656341"], "id": "2119557303963656341", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6990, "like_count": 54, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "LAUNCH at 2024 UTC Nov 8 of a CZ-12 from Hainan with  the Xingwang (SatNet) Group 29 internet sats", "url": "https://x.com/planet4589/status/2119557303963656341"}, {"author_id": "19355829", "created_at": "2026-11-08T22:03:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119551343161496028", "2119551490029461684"], "id": "2119551490029461684", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 15700, "like_count": 249, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 25, "retweet_count": 17}, "text": "Rant of the day: I hate the newfangled term PNT (for 'position, navigation and timing').  Both timing and position have been integral parts of navigation since the RGO was founded in 1675, so it's just tautological. Just say 'Nav'.", "url": "https://x.com/planet4589/status/2119551490029461684"}, {"author_id": "19355829", "created_at": "2026-11-08T22:03:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119551343161496028", "2119551490029461684"], "id": "2119551343161496028", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1081, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Rant of the day: I hate the newfangled term PNT (for 'position, navigation and timing'.  Both timing and position have been integral parts of navigation since the RGO was founded in 1675, so it's just tautological. Just say 'Nav'.", "url": "https://x.com/planet4589/status/2119551343161496028"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "11348282", "name": "NASA", "username": "NASA"}, {"id": "626660983", "name": "Lyman Stone 石來民 🦬🦬🦬", "username": "lymanstoneky"}, {"id": "21436960", "name": "European Space Agency", "username": "esa"}, {"id": "610659001", "name": "Max Roser", "username": "MaxCRoser"}, {"id": "19355829", "name": "Jonathan McDowell", "username": "planet4589"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2119833829389041896", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlzcqys351wzaa0zc4ojnbuyfp8d", "oldest_id": "2119551343161496028", "result_count": 15}}
